  "title": "Prepositions and their cases",
  "description": "Which case follows each preposition, with its meaning and an example.",
  "sections": [
    {
      "text": "Every preposition takes a fixed case, and some take two with different meanings. W, na, pod, nad, przed and za take the accusative for movement towards a place, but the locative or instrumental for being there: Kładę książkę na stół (onto), but Książka leży na stole (on).",
      "table": {
        "columns": ["Preposition", "Case", "Meaning", "Example", "In English"],
        "rows": [
          ["do", "genitive", "to, into", "Idę do domu.", "I'm going home."],
          ["od", "genitive", "from (a person); since", "List od mamy.", "A letter from Mum."],
          ["z", "genitive", "from, out of", "Jestem z Polski.", "I'm from Poland."],
          ["bez", "genitive", "without", "Kawa bez cukru.", "Coffee without sugar."],
          ["u", "genitive", "at someone's place", "Jestem u babci.", "I'm at Grandma's."],
          ["dla", "genitive", "for", "Prezent dla ciebie.", "A present for you."],
          ["obok", "genitive", "next to", "Obok sklepu.", "Next to the shop."],
          ["dzięki", "dative", "thanks to", "Dzięki tobie.", "Thanks to you."],
          [
            "przez",
            "accusative",
            "through, across; for (time)",
            "Idę przez park.",
            "I'm walking through the park."
          ],
          [
            "na",
            "accusative",
            "onto; for (an event, a time)",
            "Idę na koncert.",
            "I'm going to a concert."
          ],
          ["z", "instrumental", "with", "Kawa z mlekiem.", "Coffee with milk."],
          ["nad", "instrumental", "above; by (water)", "Nad morzem.", "By the sea."],
          ["pod", "instrumental", "under", "Pod stołem.", "Under the table."],
          [
            "przed",
            "instrumental",
            "in front of; before",
            "Przed domem.",
            "In front of the house."
          ],
          ["za", "instrumental", "behind", "Za domem.", "Behind the house."],
          ["między", "instrumental", "between", "Między nami.", "Between us."],
          ["w", "locative", "in", "W Krakowie.", "In Kraków."],
          ["na", "locative", "on; at", "Na poczcie.", "At the post office."],
          ["o", "locative", "about", "O filmie.", "About the film."],
          ["przy", "locative", "by, near", "Przy oknie.", "By the window."],
          ["po", "locative", "after; around", "Po obiedzie.", "After lunch."]
        ]
      }
    }
  ]
}
